    path: "references/font-source-introduction.md",
    text: "# Font reference provenance\n\n## Apply this\n\n- If selecting a new typeface, first inspect the specimens and license information in the relevant use-case group.\n- Compare candidates against existing typography tokens before changing the family.\n- Treat source licensing and vendor details as historical; verify current rights and font availability.\n\n## Source\n\nSource: `Font Recommendations v1.0.1.pdf`, version 1.0.1, PDF pages 1–2.\nApply this is new guidance; the source blocks below preserve the supplied pypdf extraction verbatim.\nPage images preserve the original visual content, including text absent from extraction.\n\n## Source pages\n\n### Source page 1\n\n![Source PDF page 1](../assets/font-page-001.jpg)\n\n```text\nFont Recommendations\n```\n\n### Source page 2\n\n![Source PDF page 2](../assets/font-page-002.jpg)\n\n```text\n\n```\n",
